  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.header": "Cultivation Machine",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_1": "The cultivation machine consists of a Cultivation Base and a Cultivation Tank: place the base at the bottom and plant crops in the tank.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_2": "The base needs rotational force to run; higher RPM makes crops grow faster (up to 2x).",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_3": "Right-click the tank with a plantable item to plant a crop; right-click with an empty hand to retrieve the seed.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_4": "The machine tends the crop until maturity, then harvests it automatically.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_5": "Harvested items are stored in the base and can be extracted with a Funnel or Chute.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_6": "Insert a catalyst (bone meal by default) in the base GUI to boost growth; each catalyst's duration and multipliers are configurable.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_7": "Water the crops with a Spout to double growth speed and boost harvest yield to 1.5x; running water and fertilizer together grants an extra 50%% to both bonuses.",
