  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_9": "Stack Cultivation Tanks upwards for taller crops; some tall plants need a taller structure to grow and be harvested.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.cultivation.text_10": "Crop recipes can be customized with data packs.",
