  "create_cultivation.ponder.tag.greenhouse": "Greenhouse Climate",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.tag.greenhouse.description": "Build a greenhouse, control its climate and boost your crops",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_1": "The Greenhouse Controller is the brain of the greenhouse: once powered, it scans the interior and regulates the climate.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_2": "Right-click the controller with any item to open its control panel.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_3": "Enclose the controller with Greenhouse Glass: the controller floods outward from its own cell to map the greenhouse interior.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_4": "Farmland and crops count towards the interior too; the larger the greenhouse, the more device capacity it takes to push the climate.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_5": "Three devices shape the climate: the Air Conditioner handles temperature.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_6": "The Humidifier raises humidity, consuming water through its back-plate inlet.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_7": "The Dehumidifier lowers humidity and condenses water; extract it from the back-plate outlet.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_8": "Drag the pointers in the control panel to set the target climate; the devices push the live values towards it. A steady yellow lamp means the devices cannot keep up.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_9": "The two toggles are auto mode: setpoints follow the optimal ranges of the planted crops, weighted by plant count.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_10": "Each crop has its own ranges: both optimal gives 3x yield and 9x growth speed; only one optimal gives 1.5x and 3x.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_11": "Both merely surviving means no bonus but normal growth; if either value leaves the survival range the crop stalls completely - Jade shows the state on the crop.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_12": "Attach Display Links to read the controller: live climate, device stats and the crop list with its ranges.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.text_13": "Crops outside greenhouses follow the biome's ambient climate instead - off by default, enable it in the config.",
  "create_cultivation.ponder.greenhouse.header": "Greenhouse",
